Determine and shade the intersection of the three regions:
The required region consists of all points $(x, y)$ that simultaneously satisfy:
1. $(x - 2)^2 + (y - 2)^2 \le 4$ (inside or on the circle);
2. $0 \le y \le x$ for $x > 0$ (between the horizontal axis and the $45^\circ$ line);
3. $x \le 3$ (to the left of or on the vertical line $x = 3$).
